This review supersedes the diagnosis in [the old incident page](/kb/incidents/4471),
not its history. The old page calls everything one parser bug. Neither the report
bodies nor the form-specific logic support one fix for every report.

## Scope and counts

This is the supplied export dated 4 October 2026, not a claim about today's queue.
Counts below are computed at render time from unique report IDs merged into #4471.
Refresh the source data and rebuild before using these counts for current triage.

